# GitHub Actions Secrets

Template and per-Alignerr task repositories must not store or consume privileged
workflow credentials. Trusted CI, Taiga deployment, and adversarial-review
dispatch belong to `Alignerr-Code-Labeling/lbx-rl-tasks-iso-mothership` and its
trusted control plane.

`GITHUB_TOKEN` is scoped to its repository. Do not work around that boundary by
adding a cross-repository PAT or GitHub App credential to a template/task-fork
workflow.

Do not add GitHub cross-repository, Taiga, GCP, Artifact Registry, Harbor, or
provider API secrets to template/per-Alignerr repositories. Those belong on the
mothership or its trusted control plane.

The harness-generated `problems/<task_id>/.alignerr/build_proof.json` is not a secret and should be committed before opening or updating task PRs; keep `.env.local`, `.harness-runs/`, and other local outputs out of git.
